    "kind": "inline",
    "value": "Uniform ordinary continuum consumer for exactly the eleven previously adopted109 mean-cost objectives, on134 complete actual K neighborhood. Each cost keeps its own original head, while all costs use one common q and one seven-coordinate residual simplex. Every original exponent tail is retained, and all constants f(1) are zero. Does not extend the other30 linear costs,11 quadratic costs, the signed mass and square complement, or the complete111 AP11/AP13 denominator. No full numerator, global K, Lean or unrestricted Erdos7 claim."
